  "description": "32\" Cut Width Disc Plow Harrow With 2\" Receiver Hitch Mount for ATVs /UTVs Heavy\nFitment\nThis tow-behind disc plow is compatible with any ATV or UTV model featuring a Universal 2\" Receiver. It's designed with convenience in mind, allowing you to effortlessly attach it to your vehicle.\nFeatures\nA Must For Gardening: This disc plow harrow is perfect for leveling plots, breaking up soil, leveling pastures, and grading.\nAdjustable Height: Choose the right height to level the land in a variety of different scenarios.\nStrong Compatibility: Tow-behind disc plow is compatible with any ATV or UTV model with a Universal 2\" Receiver.\nConvenient and Timesaver: Disc plow harrow saves your time and energy. It also has the function of soil loosening.\nSpecification: Universal 2\" towing receiver hitch offers cultivating solutions using your own ATV or UTV;32\" Cut Width; Weight: 70 lbs.",
